LegalEase: AI-Powered Legal Document Generator 
Project Description:  
LegalEase leverages state-of-the-art Generative AI to simplify the creation of legal documents by 
providing customizable, accurate, and editable templates for a wide range of use cases. Users can 
generate employment contracts, lease agreements, NDAs, and more—all tailored to their specific 
inputs like involved parties, effective dates, and key terms. 
Built with FastAPI and integrated with a powerful AI core, LegalEase ensures users receive 
professional-grade legal documents that maintain formatting standards, include custom branding 
(such as logos and fonts), and support features like editable previews and automatic term tables. 
With secure handling of sensitive user data and seamless document export options (.PDF, .DOCX, 
.TXT), the platform bridges the gap between accessibility and legal professionalism. 
LegalEase empowers entrepreneurs, professionals, and individuals to generate reliable legal 
content confidently—without needing a legal background. 
Scenarios:  
Scenario 1: A startup founder enters details about a new hire and selects "Employment Contract" 
as the document type. LegalEase generates a comprehensive agreement with clauses for roles, 
responsibilities, compensation, and confidentiality. The user customizes the final wording, adds 
their company logo, and downloads the document as a branded PDF. 
Scenario 2: A freelancer needs a Non-Disclosure Agreement for a potential client. By specifying 
the parties, scope of confidentiality, and effective date, they instantly receive a structured and 
legally sound NDA.  
Scenario 3: A landlord uses LegalEase to draft a residential lease agreement. By inputting the 
property address, tenant details, and lease terms, the platform creates a formatted document with 
editable sections and a downloadable version in .DOCX format.  
