MILESTONE 3: API Logic Integration 
In Milestone 3, the focus shifts to designing and integrating the backend API logic that 
powers document generation using the Gemini 1.5 Pro model. This milestone ensures a 
functional bridge between frontend inputs and the AI-powered document generation, 
which is the core of the LegalEase project. 
Activity 3.1: Create and Configure main.py 
This step involves initializing the FastAPI application, setting up the base endpoint for 
health-checks, and including modular API routes. 
Steps: 
 Initialize the FastAPI app 
 Define a root (/) endpoint to verify the service is running 
 Include routes from the routes.py module 
Activity 3.2: Handle Document Generation Logic in routes.py 
This task handles user inputs from the frontend and sends them to the Gemini model for 
document generation. 
Steps: 
 Define a Pydantic DocumentRequest model to validate incoming data. 
 Initialize the GeminiDocumentGenerator from ai_core.gemini_generator. 
 Create a POST endpoint (/generate) to accept user input and return generated 
legal content. 
