Core Functions & Utilities 
sanitize_text(text) 
 Removes special characters and typographic quotes to ensure clean formatting. 
format_docx(text, doc_type) 
 Uses python-docx to: 
o Embed logo 
o Add titles, paragraph formatting 
o Auto-generate a Terms table from semicolon-separated input 
format_pdf(text, doc_type) 
 Utilizes FPDF with custom header/footer: 
o Center-aligned logo 
o Bold headings for sections 
o Bullet-style terms 
format_html_preview(text) 
 Converts output to stylized HTML blocks for inline display. 
